From: pdx203 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Subject: gpu: per-process page tables step 0, a probe table for a CP_SMMU_TABLE_UPDATE test

A second TTBR0 table built by ArmSmmu4KBuild in the live table's format: the five kernel buffers at their GPU addresses, the
scratch address on a page of its own. The board switches the CP to it and back and checks where a write through the scratch
address landed. The leaf descriptor of the ring in both tables is reported, so the two builders' formats can be compared.

